  "setCellImage() 和 getCellImage() 用于设置和读取单元格图片，无需配置列渲染器。": "setCellImage() and getCellImage() set and read per-cell images without a column renderer. ",
  "同一列中的文字和图片可分别设置，单元格图片优先于列渲染器显示。": "Text and images can coexist in the same column. A cell image takes priority over the column renderer. ",
  "传入 undefined 可清除图片，不影响单元格的值（v）与样式（s）。": "Pass undefined to remove an image without changing the cell value (v) or style (s).",
  "链接与图片示例": "Links and images example",
  "“官网”列演示 URL 自动识别；“图片（列配置）”列使用 createImageCellRenderer()；": "The Website column demonstrates URL detection. Image (column renderer) uses createImageCellRenderer(). ",
  "“图片（单元格）”列通过 setCellImage() 为第 1、3 行设置图片。": "Image (cell property) uses setCellImage() for rows 1 and 3.",
  "包含 100,000 行 × 5 列的数据示例。数据完整保存在内存中，仅绘制当前视口附近的单元格。": "A 100,000-row, five-column example. The full dataset remains in memory; rendering covers only cells near the viewport.",
  "数据规模与渲染范围": "Data size and rendering scope",
  "示例每次加载时完整导入 100,000 行，支持滚动、编辑及列宽调整，可用于评估不同设备上的交互响应。": "Each load imports all 100,000 rows. Scrolling, editing, and column resizing help evaluate responsiveness on different devices.",
  "性能提示：CyExcelCore 只虚拟化绘制和命中测试，不会虚拟化数据导入与内存。100,000 行仍会一次性导入快照并常驻内存；移动端或低端设备建议先从 10,000–50,000 行验证，百万级数据需使用业务数据单独测试导入耗时、内存占用和滚动帧率。": "CyExcelCore virtualizes drawing and hit testing, not import or storage. All 100,000 rows are imported and kept in memory. Start with 10,000-50,000 rows on mobile or lower-end devices. For million-row datasets, measure import time, memory, and scrolling with representative data.",
  "重新加载 100,000 行": "Reload 100,000 rows",
  "导入快照：": "Snapshot import: ",
  "创建核心：": "Core initialization: ",
  "数据行：": "Data rows: ",
