  "默认加载 100,000 行数据，支持滚动与编辑。": "Loads 100,000 rows by default, with scrolling and editing enabled.",
  "getUsedRowCount() 返回实际有数据的行数；getRowCount() 返回包含尾部空白行的坐标空间行数。": "getUsedRowCount() returns the occupied row extent. getRowCount() includes trailing blank rows in the coordinate space.",
  "find() 扫描显示文本，replace() 只替换命中的那一段。": "find() searches displayed text. replace() replaces only the matching text.",
  "查找和部分替换": "Search and partial replacement",
  "搜索匹配的是用户看到的文本，而不是底层存储值。替换时保留命中文本前后的内容。": "Search matches displayed text rather than underlying values. Replacement preserves the text before and after each match.",
