  "分词区域示例": "Partial-text replacement",
  "East 是单元格文本的一部分，替换后不会覆盖整格。": "East is part of the cell text. Replacing it preserves the rest of the cell.",
  "样式以 patch 合并写入，可以只改 bold、颜色、背景或数字格式。": "Styles are merged as patches, so bold, color, background, and number format can be updated independently.",
  "按 patch 合并": "Style patches",
  "setRangeStyle() 只覆盖传入的字段。传 null 会清除对应样式，其他字段保持不变。": "setRangeStyle() updates only the supplied keys. null clears the corresponding style key and retains the others.",
  "当前选区加粗": "Bold selection",
