  "清除当前选区样式": "Clear selection styles",
  "已清除当前选区样式": "Selection styles cleared",
  "选中区域应用样式": "Apply styles to a range",
  "选择单元格区域后，可使用操作按钮设置样式。": "Select a cell range and use the buttons to apply styles.",
  "createSheet() 默认提供工具栏和编辑栏，支持通过 schema 自定义工具栏内容。": "createSheet() includes a toolbar and formula bar by default. Customize toolbar items through its schema.",
