  "插件观察 #": "Plugin observation #",
  "插件事件审计": "Plugin event audit",
  "每次写入或插入行均提交一次 Command，并触发 change 事件。": "Each write or row insertion commits a Command and emits a change event.",
  "PluginManager 会在插件卸载时自动清理 events、hooks、菜单和快捷键注册。": "PluginManager automatically cleans up event, hook, menu, and shortcut registrations when a plugin is disposed.",
  "面向浏览器的表格组件，采用稀疏矩阵存储和 Canvas 虚拟化渲染，支持命令事务与编辑历史管理。": "A browser spreadsheet component with sparse storage, virtualized Canvas rendering, command transactions, and edit history.",
  "组件概述": "Component overview",
  "cyexcel 将数据模型、布局计算、渲染和变更记录划分为独立模块。绘制范围限制在视口附近，编辑操作通过命令与事务提交，并记录可撤销的变更。": "cyexcel separates data, layout, rendering, and change history into modules. Drawing is limited to the viewport area. Edits are committed through commands and transactions, with undoable changes recorded in history.",
  "Canvas 虚拟化": "Canvas virtualization",
  "仅绘制视口附近的单元格，减少滚动时的绘制开销。": "Draw only cells near the viewport to reduce scrolling overhead.",
  "Command 事务": "Command transactions",
  "单元格、结构、样式和行高变化都经过统一命令层。": "Cell, structure, style, and row-height changes use a shared command layer.",
  "撤销 / 重做": "Undo / redo",
  "编辑、合并、插入、删除和样式修改可以进入同一份历史记录。": "Edits, merges, insertion, deletion, and style changes can share the same history.",
  "框架无关": "Framework independent",
  "支持通过 CyExcelCore 接入原生页面及 React、Vue 等框架。": "Integrate CyExcelCore into plain HTML, React, Vue, and other frameworks.",
  "createWorkbook() 提供工作表添加、删除、切换与重命名功能。": "createWorkbook() supports adding, deleting, switching, and renaming sheets.",
  "十万行示例": "100,000-row example",
  "提供 100,000 行 × 5 列的数据示例，用于评估导入、编辑和滚动表现。": "A 100,000-row, five-column example for evaluating import, editing, and scrolling.",
  "支持单元格选择、滚动、编辑和列宽调整。": "Supports cell selection, scrolling, editing, and column resizing.",
  "快速开始": "Quick start",
  "安装组件，将二维数组转换为数据快照，并使用快照创建表格实例。": "Install the component, convert a two-dimensional array to a snapshot, and create a spreadsheet instance.",
  "安装": "Installation",
  "在已有前端工程中安装当前包：": "Install the package in an existing frontend project:",
  "创建表格": "Create a spreadsheet",
  "createSheet() 用于创建包含工具栏和编辑栏的表格实例。": "createSheet() creates a spreadsheet with a toolbar and formula bar.",
  "初始数据通过 WorkbookSnapshot 导入，组件不与原始数组建立响应式绑定。": "Initial data is imported through a WorkbookSnapshot, without a reactive binding to the source array.",
  "二维数组的第 i 行、第 j 列映射到单元格 (i, j)。未设置自定义表头时，列标题使用 A、B、C 等字母。表格编辑不会修改原始数组。": "Row i, column j maps to cell (i, j). Without custom headers, columns use A, B, C, and so on. Editing the sheet does not modify the source array.",
  "带工具栏的表格": "Spreadsheet with toolbar",
  "使用 createSheet() 创建，包含撤销重做、格式、数据操作和结构操作入口。": "Created with createSheet(), including controls for history, formatting, data, and structural operations.",
  "数据验证规则，缺省视为空": "Validation rules; omitted means empty",
